@startuml
title Connection Manager (Alpaca) Sequence Flows

' Formatting configurations
skinparam BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif

' Participant Definitions
participant "Alpaca API" as Alpaca
box "Connection Manager (Alpaca)" #EFF6FF
  participant "WS Client" as WSClient
  participant "gRPC Server" as gRPCServer
  participant "Order Controller" as OrderCtrl
  participant "Kafka Producer" as KafkaProd
end box
participant "Load Balancer" as LB
participant "Combined OMS" as COS
participant "Kafka Cluster" as Kafka

== Flow 1: Live Market Data Streaming ==
autonumber 1.1
Alpaca -> WSClient : Stream raw stock candle (Websocket)
WSClient -> gRPCServer : Handle bar callback
gRPCServer -> LB : Broadcast bar payload (gRPC Server Stream)
LB -> : Route to SignalGen replicas (gRPC)

== Flow 2: Order Submission ==
autonumber 2.1
COS -> gRPCServer : PlaceOrder(OrderRequest) (gRPC Unary)
gRPCServer -> OrderCtrl : Submit order payload
OrderCtrl -> Alpaca : submit_order() (REST HTTP POST)
Alpaca --> OrderCtrl : Return Order confirmation
OrderCtrl --> gRPCServer : Format OrderResponse DTO
gRPCServer --> COS : Return OrderResponse
COS -> : SADD to orders:pending & block margin (Redis)

== Flow 3: Live Order Status Forwarding ==
autonumber 3.1
Alpaca -> WSClient : Order fill/update message (Websocket)
WSClient -> KafkaProd : Callback triggered (raw JSON)
KafkaProd -> Kafka : Publish raw-order-update event (Kafka Topic)
Kafka -> COS : Consume raw-order-update
COS -> : SREM from orders:pending & update settled state (Redis)

== Flow 4: Order Status Reconciliation (Fallback) ==
autonumber 4.1
COS -> gRPCServer : GetOrderStatus(OrderQuery) (gRPC Unary)
gRPCServer -> OrderCtrl : Fetch order ID status
OrderCtrl -> Alpaca : get_order_by_id() (REST HTTP GET)
Alpaca --> OrderCtrl : Return active Order details
OrderCtrl --> gRPCServer : Format OrderStatusResponse DTO
gRPCServer --> COS : Return OrderStatusResponse

@enduml
